eate bullets from essence.* Resistance charms enabling a person to shrug off lethal injuries, heck a solar with a few instances of ox-body would probably take a bit not to be mistaken for a vampire or something just due to being able to survive things that really should be lethal.<br /> <br /> <br /> *Not counting the fun of being able to use righteous devil charms if the MA style was somehow deemed to exist, be figured out, and such.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-18T02:37:21-07:00","id":1331454,"title":"","content":"Well, its basically an MIB setting. More grimdark. <br /> <br /> Let's say that our dear protagonist is surrounded. He's holding off an army of cultists, demons, ghosts, and worse to let his friends evacuate. The children they are sent to rescue are long dead. He's injured. His gun has 1 bullet left. And he stands his ground. And then, Exaltation. <br /> <br /> What should the first few seconds be like? And then, the next few hours?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-18T05:41:24-07:00","id":1331460,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_pos